      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Where can someone in Germany buy tattoo needles safely?",
          "user_rubrik": "Where to buy tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "In Germany, you can safely purchase tattoo needles from several online retailers. Some reliable options include:\n\n1. **Amazon.de**: They offer a wide range of tattoo supplies, including needles, often with customer reviews to ensure quality.\n2. **Tattoo Supply Websites**: Websites like \"Tattoo-Med\" or \"Kreuzberg Tattoo Supply\" specialize in tattoo supplies and often carry a variety of needle types.\n3. **Local Tattoo Shops**: Visiting local tattoo studios can also be a good option, as they may sell supplies or can recommend trusted suppliers.\n4. **eBay**: You can find tattoo needles on eBay, but ensure you buy from reputable sellers with good ratings.\n\nAlways check for sterilization and quality certifications when purchasing needles to ensure safety.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0013-41-04803:0": 0.6211874485015869,
            "clueweb22-en0031-20-16817:0": 0.5139260292053223,
