        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "What are some tattoo ink brands that are considered safe in Europe right now?",
          "user_rubrik": "What learning resources are available about tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Some tattoo ink brands considered safe and compliant with EU regulations in Germany include Intenze, Kuro Sumi, and Dynamic. These brands have been noted for their quality and adherence to safety standards. However, it's important to verify that the specific products you choose are labeled as REACH compliant, as the availability of compliant inks can vary due to recent regulatory changes affecting the tattoo industry in Europe. Always check with suppliers for the latest information on compliant products.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0000-53-19806:1": 0.5976217985153198
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "3 : I live in Germany;"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 8,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that's useful! What about online resources for tattooing basics or tutorials, preferably in German?",
          "user_rubrik": "What learning resources are available about tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Here are some online resources for tattooing basics and tutorials in German:\n\n1. **YouTube Channels**: Look for channels like \"Tattoo Tutorials\" or \"Tattoo Artist\" which often provide in-depth tutorials in German.\n\n2. **Udemy Courses**: Platforms like Udemy offer tattoo courses that may have German subtitles or are taught in German. Search for courses like \"Master Tattoo Class\" or \"Beginners Guide to Tattooing.\"\n\n3. **Websites and Blogs**: Websites such as \"Tattoo-Magazin.de\" often feature articles and tutorials on tattoo techniques and tips in German.\n\n4. **Social Media Groups**: Join Facebook groups or Instagram pages dedicated to tattooing where you can find German-speaking artists sharing their knowledge.\n\n5. **Online Forums**: Platforms like Reddit have specific subreddits for tattooing where you can ask questions and find resources in German.\n\nThese resources should help you get started with your tattooing hobby!",
          "citations": {
