          "user_utterance": "I'm looking into starting tattooing as a hobby. What steps should I take first?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Begin by honing your artistic abilities, as strong drawing and design skills are crucial for tattooing [clueweb22-en0024-21-00136]. Next, familiarize yourself with the basics of tattoo safety and hygiene, including sterilization and proper equipment handling [clueweb22-en0022-31-15676]. Invest in beginner-friendly equipment such as a tattoo machine, inks, stencils, and cleaning supplies, and practice on fake skin before attempting tattoos on people. Online courses and tutorials can provide structured learning, but traditional apprenticeships under experienced artists remain the gold standard for hands-on training and understanding local regulations [clueweb22-en0031-07-10226; clueweb22-en0025-87-09139]. Which beginner tattoo kits are recommended?",
