          "text": "For beginners in Germany, several tattoo kits are popular and accessible online. The Wormhole Tattoo Kit for Beginners is highly rated and includes two tattoo machines, power supply, 10 inks, 30 needles, practice skin, and a user manual, making it a comprehensive starter set. The Dragonhawk Traditional Pro Complete Tattoo Kit is another excellent choice, featuring two machines for lining and shading, a power supply with LCD, and a variety of accessories. The Solong Beginner Tattoo Kit is also recommended, offering two pro tattoo guns, 54 ink colors, 50 needles, and all necessary accessories for basic tattoo work. These kits are available on platforms like Amazon Germany and are designed to help you practice safely and effectively before tattooing on real skin. Always ensure you follow safety guidelines and consider starting with practice skin as recommended by manufacturers [DOC-1][DOC-2][DOC-3]. Are you interested in online courses or tutorials for beginner tattoo artists?",
