          "text": "Safe tattoo hygiene means using sterile, single-use needles, wearing gloves, and thoroughly disinfecting all surfaces and equipment. Tattoo needle types include liners (for outlines), shaders (for shading and coloring), and magnums (for filling large areas). Do you want aftercare tips for new tattoos?",
