        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Yes, aftercare tips would be great! Where can I buy tattoo needles safely in Germany?",
          "user_rubrik": "Where to buy tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Tattoo aftercare is crucial for proper healing: always clean your tattoo gently with antibacterial, skin-sensitive soap, especially after activities like working out, and apply a high-quality, unscented or vegan-friendly lotion such as After Inked Tattoo Aftercare Lotion to keep the area hydrated and reduce itching or scabbing [clueweb22-en0018-69-00589][clueweb22-en0016-91-14332][clueweb22-en0034-32-13853]. Avoid tight clothing that may rub against the tattoo, and consider using tattoo aftercare kits for convenience [clueweb22-en0033-13-05988]. For buying tattoo needles in Germany, look for reputable online suppliers such as Amazon.de or specialized tattoo supply shops that offer sterile, single-use needles in various types (liners, shaders, magnums) and sizes. Always check that the packaging is intact and the needles are individually sealed for safety [clueweb22-en0015-21-00443]. Would you like recommendations for specific German tattoo supply shops?",
