          "user_utterance": "Yes, please! Also, what does it mean when tattoo needles are REACH compliant?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "In Germany, reputable online tattoo supply shops include Barber DTS (barberdts.com/de), Magic Moon (magicmoon-shop.de), and Amazon.de, all of which offer a wide range of sterile, single-use tattoo needles in various types and sizes. When purchasing, always check that the packaging is intact and the needles are individually sealed for safety [clueweb22-en0015-21-00443]. REACH compliance refers to the European Union's chemical safety regulation, which ensures that tattoo needles (and especially inks) do not contain harmful substances and are safe for use on human skin. Since January 2022, only REACH-compliant products can be legally sold and used in the EU, providing an extra layer of safety for both artists and clients [clueweb22-en0000-83-16967]. Are you interested in REACH-compliant tattoo ink recommendations?",
