          "text": "For REACH-compliant and vegan tattoo inks in Germany, consider World Famous Tattoo Ink, which is both vegan-friendly and EU-approved, making it a popular choice for beginners and professionals alike. Their 6 Color Set is budget-friendly and comes in secure, tamper-proof packaging [clueweb22-en0028-37-11965]. Kuro Sumi is another trusted brand, known for its all-natural, vegan, and cruelty-free formula, with vibrant and long-lasting colors [clueweb22-en0009-40-19791]. Millennium Moms Tattoo Ink is also vegan-friendly, made with herbal ingredients, and approved by EU health authorities, offering a wide range of bright and fade-resistant colors [clueweb22-en0028-37-11965]. All these brands are available through reputable suppliers and online platforms in Germany. REACH compliance ensures that these inks do not contain harmful substances restricted by EU regulations, providing extra safety for both artists and clients [clueweb22-en0000-83-16967].",
