          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For beginners, it's recommended to purchase a complete tattoo kit, which typically includes a tattoo machine (sometimes two, for lining and shading), a digital power supply, foot pedal, clip cord, sterilized needles, ink, grips, ink caps, and practice skin. These kits often come with additional accessories such as rubber bands, o-rings, grommets, and a carrying case, making it easier to get started without buying each item individually [DOC-1][DOC-4]. Hygiene is critical, so you must also have disposable gloves, disinfectants, and single-use or sterilizable equipment to ensure safety and compliance with health standards [DOC-4]. Many kits also provide online guides or instructional videos to help you set up and use the equipment properly [DOC-4]. Would you like recommendations for specific beginner tattoo kits available in Germany?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0025-66-04926:0": 0.05268167467655959,
            "clueweb22-en0025-66-04926:3": 0.05187766163375919,
            "clueweb22-en0032-43-06101:4": 0.05104525115018592,
            "clueweb22-en0025-66-04926:7": 0.04834572017696112
