            "I like making up crazy stories for normal events.",
            "I live in Germany."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "No need for visuals, thanks! Where do people usually buy tattoo needles in Germany?",
          "user_rubrik": "Where to buy tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Tattoo needles in Germany are commonly purchased through online platforms like Amazon.de, where brands such as Yuelong and Autdor offer pre-sterilized, individually packaged needles in various configurations suitable for both lining and shading [DOC-1][DOC-2][DOC-3]. These suppliers are trusted by both hobbyists and professionals and provide fast shipping options within Germany. Additionally, there are specialized tattoo supply stores online that cater specifically to the German market, ensuring compliance with local safety and hygiene standards. When purchasing, it's important to choose needles made from medical-grade stainless steel and to verify that they are CE-approved and pre-sterilized for safe use [DOC-1][DOC-2]. Are you interested in learning about other essential tattoo supplies?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0008-01-12699:6": 0.03252247488101534,
            "clueweb22-en0032-44-10842:2": 0.02967032967032967,
            "clueweb22-en0015-40-18493:0": 0.028958333333333336,
            "clueweb22-en0024-93-15844:1": 0.026709401709401708
