    "topic": "8-2",
    "responses": [
      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking into how to start tattooing as a hobby. Can you give me some info on where to begin?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Begin by purchasing a reputable beginner tattoo kit, such as those from Yuelong, DragonHawk, or Solong, which typically include tattoo machines for lining and shading, power supplies, needles, ink, practice skin, and essential accessories like cleaning brushes and adjustment tools [DOC-1][DOC-3][DOC-5]. Before tattooing yourself or others, thoroughly read the instruction manual included in your kit and watch online tutorials for additional guidance [DOC-2]. It's crucial to practice your designs on practice skin or fruit (like apples or pears) to develop your skills, as tattooing on human skin is permanent and requires confidence and precision [DOC-2]. Always prioritize safety and hygiene by using sterilized equipment and following proper cleaning procedures. If you are in Germany, also check local regulations regarding tattooing at home, as there may be legal requirements or restrictions. How do I properly sterilize tattoo equipment?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0020-24-16033:20": 0.04554079696394687,
            "clueweb22-en0042-99-10026:8": 0.04305486086368661,
            "clueweb22-en0024-21-00136:17": 0.04114316453618776,
