      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great info, thanks! Where could I buy EU-compliant tattoo inks in Germany\u2014are there online shops or local art stores?",
          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Since the EU's REACH regulations came into effect, only certain tattoo inks are legal for use in Germany, and these must be free from banned chemicals and meet strict safety standards. Professional tattoo supply websites such as Barber DTS, Killer Ink, and Magic Moon are popular online sources that specifically advertise REACH-compliant inks for the German and EU market. These shops offer a range of brands that have reformulated their products to comply with the new rules. Local art supply stores generally do not stock tattoo inks, as these are considered specialized products and are subject to health and safety regulations. When purchasing, always check that the ink is labeled as REACH-compliant or EU-compliant, and avoid buying from unverified sources to ensure safety and legality. The new regulations are strictly enforced in Germany, so using compliant inks is essential for both health and legal reasons [DOC-1][DOC-3][DOC-4]. Which tattoo ink brands are most recommended for beginners in Germany?",
          "citations": {
