      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Perfect, thanks! Which tattoo ink brands are most recommended for beginners here in Germany? Any that are especially easy to work with and safe?",
          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For beginners in Germany, Millennium Mom\u2019s is highly recommended due to its EU approval, vegan-friendly formula, and wide color range, making it suitable for both outlining and shading. World Famous Tattoo Ink is another excellent choice, offering REACH-compliant, vegan-friendly inks in beginner sets with secure packaging, and is widely used by artists globally. StarBrite inks are praised for their non-toxic, gamma-sterilized formula and vivid, long-lasting colors, while Kuro Sumi is known for its organic, water-based ingredients and ease of use, especially for outlining. All these brands are available from reputable tattoo supply shops and are considered safe and easy to work with for hobbyists and beginners in Germany. Always ensure the inks are labeled as REACH/EU-compliant when purchasing online or from local suppliers to meet legal and safety standards [clueweb22-en0045-80-01323][clueweb22-en0028-37-11965]. Are you interested in starter kits that include these inks?",
          "citations": {
