      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "A comparison of starter kits available in Germany would be awesome\u2014please! Also, what\u2019s the big difference between liner and shader needles?",
          "user_rubrik": "What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "Top beginner tattoo kits in Germany include DragonHawk, Solong, Hildbrandt, Getbetterlife, ITATOO, and Artist World, most of which come with practice skin, design tools, and a range of inks. Liner needles are tightly grouped for crisp outlines, while shader needles are spread out for smooth shading and coloring. Would you like links to specific shops in Germany selling these kits?",
