      {
        "turn": 9,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Yes, tips on choosing needle sizes for specific designs would be super helpful! Also, is there a favorite needle type for tattooing on practice skin?",
          "user_rubrik": "Where to buy tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Choose smaller round liner (RL) needles (e.g., 3RL, 5RL) for fine outlines, round shader (RS) needles for shading and coloring, and magnum (M1, RM) needles for blending and filling larger areas. For practice skin, round liners and shaders in medium sizes (5RL, 7RS) are favorites for beginners. Do you want tips on cleaning and disposing of used needles safely?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0017-62-10056:1": 0.07387567158365121,
