      {
        "turn": 12,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That clears things up, thanks! What about books or online courses for learning design skills specific to tattooing? Any recommendations?",
          "user_rubrik": "What learning resources are available about tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For learning tattoo design skills, 'Great Book of Tattoo Designs' by Lora S. Irish is highly recommended\u2014it offers over 500 tattoo-friendly patterns and practical advice on adapting art for skin, making it a valuable reference for beginners [clueweb22-en0038-34-01799]. Online, the Master Tattoo Class on Udemy is a top-rated course for beginners, covering fundamentals and practical techniques [clueweb22-en0031-07-10226]. Daniel Silva Tattoo University also provides comprehensive online classes, including Tattooing 101 and technique series, suitable for all levels [clueweb22-en0004-38-07549]. While hands-on apprenticeships are the traditional route, these books and courses can help you build foundational design skills and prepare a portfolio [clueweb22-en0025-87-09139]. Do you want tips for building a tattoo art portfolio?",
