  {
    "runtag": "orga-gpt41mini-bm25-minilm-llama70b-nopersonal",
    "type": "ikat-dialog-v1",
    "topic": "8-2",
    "responses": [
      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m curious about starting tattooing as a hobby. What\u2019s the first step?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To get a tattoo, you should start by choosing the placement of your tattoo, deciding on a design, and selecting a qualified artist. It's essential to research and choose an artist who has a portfolio that aligns with your desired style. You can also take a quiz to help you narrow down your design options. Once you've made these decisions, you can confidently move forward",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0028-52-08765:0": 2.8162879943847656,
            "clueweb22-en0020-77-16392:18": 2.36836576461792,
            "clueweb22-en0029-38-05666:18": 2.140481472015381,
            "clueweb22-en0020-77-16392:16": 2.0353574752807617,
            "clueweb22-en0012-14-05543:7": 2.027177572250366
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s more about getting a tattoo. I meant: how do I *learn* to tattoo myself or others as a hobby? What equipment or resources should I start with?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 4,
          "text": "To learn tattooing as a hobby, start with the basics. Research and understand the fundamentals, including safety protocols and sanitation. You'll need a tattoo machine and chair. Find online tutorials, such as YouTube videos, to learn the basics. Practice on fake skin",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0001-91-13299:6": 3.224273920059204,
            "clueweb22-en0039-46-18327:10": 1.432185411453247,
            "clueweb22-en0018-69-05657:13": 1.3454089164733887,
            "clueweb22-en0039-46-18327:9": 1.1700074672698975,
            "clueweb22-en0018-69-05657:12": 0.8811770677566528
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Got it! So, what are the full details of equipment I\u2019d need to actually begin tattooing (like machine brands, needles, inks, hygiene stuff)?",
          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To begin tattooing, you'll need a tattoo machine, such as a coil or rotary machine, from brands like Solong or Hildbrandt. You'll also need tattoo needles, inks, and hygiene supplies like gloves, disinfectants, and antibacterial soap. A starter kit can be a good option, as it usually includes everything you need to get started, such as machines, needles, inks, and practice skin. Additionally, you'll need a power supply, foot pedal, and clip cord to operate the machine. It's essential to prioritize hygiene and safety, so make sure to invest in high-quality equipment and follow proper sanitation protocols. You can find starter kits and individual equipment online or at tattoo supply stores.   Please let me know if I can assist you further.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0024-21-00136:15": 4.3709564208984375,
            "clueweb22-en0032-43-06101:4": 3.9909191131591797,
            "clueweb22-en0032-43-06101:5": 3.809736490249634,
            "clueweb22-en0020-24-16033:21": 3.751344680786133,
            "clueweb22-en0025-66-04926:6": 3.556678533554077
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Cool, thanks! What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik": "What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are several types of tattoo needles, including round liner needles, round shader needles, flat shaders, and magnum needles. The number of needles attached to the needle bar can also vary, with magnum needle groups ranging from 5 to 55 needles on one bar. Each type of needle is designed for specific purposes, such as outlining, shading, or coloring. For example, needles with fewer points are used for outlining, while many-headed needles are used for shading and coloring. The size of the needle also matters, with smaller needles used for defining outlines and larger needles used for shading. Additionally, needles can be made from high-quality medical-grade stainless steel and come in different configurations, such as 3RL, 5RL, 7RL, and 9RL.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0022-31-15676:5": 4.833305358886719,
            "clueweb22-en0046-30-10934:6": 3.8150157928466797,
            "clueweb22-en0011-42-12453:2": 3.6107819080352783,
            "clueweb22-en0015-87-00138:7": 3.4534997940063477,
            "clueweb22-en0008-01-12699:6": 3.216002941131592
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Super helpful! Where do I buy tattoo needles? Any reliable online shops\u2014especially for Germany?",
          "user_rubrik": "Where to buy tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "You can find reliable online shops for tattoo needles in Germany through Amazon or other online marketplaces. Some popular brands like Wormhole and Mast Tattoo offer high-quality needles on Amazon. Additionally, you can also check with local tattoo supply stores in Germany or online forums for recommendations on reliable sellers. It's essential to ensure that the needles you purchase are from reputable sources and meet the necessary hygiene and safety standards. You can also check the reviews and ratings of the sellers before making a purchase to ensure you're getting high-quality products.   Please let me know if I can assist you further.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0029-39-00825:15": -0.03818054497241974,
            "clueweb22-en0046-30-10934:7": -0.14295652508735657,
            "clueweb22-en0010-36-13063:3": -0.48635196685791016,
            "clueweb22-en0042-27-02801:2": -0.707984447479248,
            "clueweb22-en0008-79-06293:3": -0.8411015272140503
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Nice! I've heard about REACH compliance. What does \"REACH compliant\" mean for tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "REACH compliance refers to the European Union's regulation on the safe use of chemicals. For tattoo needles, being REACH compliant means that the materials used to manufacture the needles meet the EU's safety standards, ensuring they do not contain hazardous substances that can harm human health or the environment. This includes the type of metal used, coatings, and other components. When purchasing tattoo needles, look for products that are labeled as REACH compliant to ensure you are using safe and regulated equipment. This is particularly important for tattoo artists in Europe, as non-compliant products may be banned or restricted.   Please let me know if I can assist you further.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0000-53-19806:2": 2.095900058746338,
            "clueweb22-en0000-53-19806:3": 1.824272632598877,
            "clueweb22-en0022-38-05495:2": 0.9944241046905518,
            "clueweb22-en0000-53-19806:1": -0.08439122140407562,
            "clueweb22-en0018-61-05246:5": -1.2873759269714355
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That makes sense, thanks! What would you say are the best books or guides for beginners learning tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik": "What learning resources are available about tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For beginners learning tattooing, some recommended books include \"Basic Fundamentals of Modern Tattoo\" and \"The Tattoo Textbook\". These books cover the basics of tattooing, including machine components, needle configurations, and sterilization standards. Additionally, online resources and tutorials can provide valuable guidance and tips for getting started with tattooing. It's also essential to find a reputable apprenticeship or mentorship program to learn from experienced tattoo artists. Remember to always prioritize safety and hygiene when practicing tattooing.   Please let me know if I can assist you further.",
          "citations": {
