    "responses": [
      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I want to know how to start tattooing as a hobby. Where should I begin?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To start tattooing",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0029-38-05666:17": 0.12664611637592316,
            "clueweb22-en0023-59-08732:2": -0.2807789444923401,
            "clueweb22-en0027-86-07583:8": -0.36034682393074036,
            "clueweb22-en0007-38-00737:0": -0.4619227647781372,
            "clueweb22-en0021-27-13865:0": -0.5922689437866211
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That doesn\u2019t really answer my question. Can you give clear steps or advice for beginners starting tattooing just as a hobby? Maybe info on equipment, practice, and safety?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "As a beginner, it's essential to start by reading the instruction manual carefully and watching teaching videos. Practice your design on fake skin, such as practice skins or fruits, to improve your skills before moving to human skin. You'll need basic equipment like a tattoo gun, ink, and stencils. Make sure to choose a minimal design to start with and have confidence. It's also crucial to follow proper safety and hygiene procedures, such as sterilizing your equipment, to avoid any risks. Start with simple designs and gradually move to more complex ones as you gain experience and build your skills.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0042-99-10026:8": 0.9222013354301453,
            "clueweb22-en0022-31-15676:15": 0.2440245896577835,
            "clueweb22-en0009-42-15427:1": -1.022064208984375,
            "clueweb22-en0003-57-09781:5": -1.385339617729187,
            "clueweb22-en0003-57-09781:4": -1.5591298341751099
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That helps, thanks! Can you list the specific basic equipment needed for tattooing? Are there particular items or brands recommended for beginners?",
          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "As a beginner, you'll need a tattoo gun, ink, stencils, and a power supply. A foot pedal is also essential for controlling the gun. You may want to consider a beginner's tattoo kit that includes these basics. Some popular brands offer kits with everything you need to get started. When choosing a kit, look for one that includes a quality power supply and a reliable foot pedal. Additionally, make sure to research and invest in good quality ink and stencils to ensure the best results. It's also important to note that some kits may come with additional items like gloves, needles, and cleaning supplies, which are also necessary for safe and hygienic tattooing.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0020-24-16033:1": 3.5814473628997803,
            "clueweb22-en0022-31-15676:15": 3.3139233589172363,
            "clueweb22-en0022-31-15676:0": 1.1415948867797852,
            "clueweb22-en0039-65-13482:0": 1.0981544256210327,
            "clueweb22-en0014-92-17969:4": 1.011816382408142
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that\u2019s clear! Now, what types of tattoo needles are there? What are the main differences between them?",
          "user_rubrik": "What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are several types of tattoo needles, including flat, round, turbo, magnum, and shader needles. Each type has a different output and is used for specific purposes, such as thin strokes, shading, or filling. The size of the needle also matters, with smaller needles suitable for defining outlines and larger needles better for shading. It's essential to choose the right needle type and size for the design you're working on to achieve the best results. As a beginner, it's recommended to start with a basic set of needles and experiment with different types and sizes as you gain experience.   Please let me know if I can assist you further!   (",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0022-31-15676:4": 4.003638744354248,
            "clueweb22-en0022-31-15676:5": 3.351499319076538,
            "clueweb22-en0009-40-04228:0": 2.240318536758423,
            "clueweb22-en0015-60-03031:9": 2.0342116355895996,
            "clueweb22-en0009-40-04228:2": 1.6049714088439941
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Where can I buy tattoo needles, especially in Germany? Are there popular online stores for tattoo supplies?",
          "user_rubrik": "Where to buy tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "You can find tattoo needles and other supplies at specialized tattoo stores or online retailers. In Germany, you can try visiting local tattoo studios or searching online for stores that ship to Germany. Some popular online stores for tattoo supplies include eBay and Amazon, which often have a wide selection of needles and other equipment from various brands. Additionally, you can also check out online marketplaces or forums dedicated to tattooing, where you can find recommendations for reputable suppliers and online stores. Make sure to research and choose a reliable seller to ensure you're getting high-quality and safe products.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0046-30-10934:7": 1.7863467931747437,
            "clueweb22-en0011-42-12453:3": 1.6261335611343384,
