      {
        "turn": 8,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting, I\u2019ll make sure to pay attention to the labels. Can you recommend any beginner-friendly books or online courses for learning tattoo techniques? I\u2019d prefer something in English or German.",
          "user_rubrik": "What learning resources are available about tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For learning tattoo techniques, you can find numerous online courses and books in both English and German. Some popular online platforms offer courses on tattooing, such as Udemy or Skillshare, which have a wide range of courses in English. In German, you can check out websites like Deutsche Welle or online forums dedicated to tattooing, which often have tutorials and guides for beginners. As for books, you can search for \"Tattoo-Techniken f\u00fcr Anf\u00e4nger\" or \"Tattooing for Beginners\" on online bookstores like Amazon, which should give you a list of suitable books in both languages. Additionally, many tattoo artists share their knowledge and techniques on YouTube, so you can also search for beginner-friendly tattooing channels in English or German.   Please let me know if I can assist you further!   (",
