          "text": "To start tattooing as a hobby, you'll need a tattoo machine, also known as a tattoo gun, and tattoo ink. You can purchase a tattoo kit that includes the machine, ink, and other necessary tools like needles and grips. These kits usually come with a power supply and a foot pedal. It's recommended to start with a minimal design and practice on fake skin before moving to human skin. You can also consider using a tattoo pen machine, which is a more modern and user-friendly option. Additionally, make sure to choose high-quality, sterile needles and ink to ensure safety and good results.",
