          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "As a beginner, you'll want to look for brands that offer high-quality, easy-to-use products. For tattoo pens, Dragonhawk is a popular choice among hobbyists and professionals alike. They offer a range of quiet and lightweight machines that are perfect for those who value a peaceful environment. For inks, look for brands like Millennium Mom's or Kuro Sumi, which offer a wide range of vibrant, long-lasting colors that are perfect for beginners. These brands are also known for their safety and sterility, which is essential for anyone new to tattooing. Additionally, Starbrite is another great option for inks, they have a wide range of colors and are known for their high-quality formula.",
