      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, great suggestions. I\u2019m curious\u2014what different tattoo needle types are there?",
          "user_rubrik": "What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are several types of tattoo needles, including round liner needles, round shader needles, flat shader needles, and magnum needles. Round liner needles are used for outlining and creating fine details, while round shader needles are used for shading and filling in large areas. Flat shader needles are used for broad strokes and filling in large areas, and magnum needles are used for bold lines and thick shading. Each type of needle has its own unique characteristics and is suited for specific techniques and effects. As a beginner, it's a good idea to start with a basic set of needles that includes a variety of sizes and types to get a feel for what works best for you.",
          "citations": {
