          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "In Germany, you can buy tattoo needles both online and in stores. There are several online retailers that sell tattoo needles, such as Tatmate, which offers a wide range of needles and other tattoo supplies. You can also find tattoo needles in specialty stores that sell tattoo equipment and supplies. Additionally, some tattoo studios may also sell needles and other supplies to hobbyists and professionals. However, it's worth noting that in Germany, tattoo equipment can only be sold to registered studios, so you may need to provide proof of registration or a certificate from your local environmental health department to purchase needles and other supplies.",
