      {
        "turn": 10,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Good to know! I\u2019ve seen some products labeled as \u201cREACH compliant.\u201d What does that mean for tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "REACH compliance refers to the European Union's Registration, Evaluation, Authorization, and Restriction of Chemicals regulation. For tattoo needles, it means that the materials used, such as the metal and coatings, meet the EU's safety standards for chemical substances. When buying tattoo needles in Germany, look for REACH-compliant products to ensure they adhere to these safety regulations. This is particularly important for tattooing, as it involves breaking the skin and introducing foreign substances into the body. REACH compliance provides an added layer of assurance regarding the safety of the tattoo needles.",
