          "text": "For beginners, a rotary tattoo machine is recommended as it's easier to handle and more versatile. Brands like Cheyenne or FK Irons are popular among tattoo artists. For practice, you can use synthetic skin or pig skin, which can be found online or at tattoo supply stores. These materials mimic the feel and texture of human skin, allowing you to practice and hone your skills before working on actual tattoos. Always ensure you follow proper hygiene and safety guidelines when practicing.",
