          "user_utterance": "Thanks! Speaking of needles\u2014what different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik": "What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are several types of tattoo needles, each designed for specific techniques and effects. Some common types include: - Liner needles: used for creating fine lines and details - Shader needles: used for creating smooth, even shading - Magnum needles: used for creating bold, textured lines - Round needles: used for creating rounded, smooth lines - Flat needles: used for creating flat, even lines - Magnums with a round tip: used for creating bold, rounded lines - Magnums with a flat tip: used for creating bold, flat lines - Magnums with a sharp tip: used for creating bold, detailed lines - Magnums with a ball tip: used for creating bold, rounded lines with a textured effect - Magnums with a flat tip and a ball: used for creating bold, flat lines with a textured effect - Magnums with a sharp tip and a ball: used for creating bold, detailed lines with a textured effect - Magnums with",
