          "user_utterance": "Where can someone in Germany buy tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik": "Where to buy tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "In Germany, you can find tattoo needles from various sources. Businesses like Air-Art Atelier Breker in Bergheim trade tattoo equipment. You might also find them from manufacturers such as MT.DERM in Berlin, which produces tattoo machines and needles. Additionally, tattoo trade shows held across Germany are often good places to purchase equipment.",
