        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m just curious about tattooing! How does one even get started with it as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To start tattooing as a hobby, it's highly recommended to begin by practicing on fake skin made of materials like rubber or pigskin, or even on fruits like apples and pears, to develop your technique. Focus on learning basic skills such as outlining, coloring, and shading. While formal training isn't strictly necessary for a hobby, understanding equipment use, sterilization, and infection prevention is crucial for safety.",
