        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Cool, thanks! What equipment do people need if they want to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To start tattooing as a hobby, you'll primarily need a tattoo machine (rotary machines are often recommended for beginners), a power supply, foot pedal, and a clip cord. Essential supplies also include various tattoo needles, tattoo ink, grips, and tips. For practice, make sure to get practice skin, ink caps, O-rings, grommets, rubber bands, and disposable gloves. Transfer paper is also useful for designs.",
