        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "What does it mean if tattoo needles are REACH compliant?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "REACH compliance primarily refers to tattoo *inks*, not needles. It means the inks adhere to the European Union's Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals (REACH) regulation. This regulation sets maximum concentration limits for substances in inks to prevent harmful effects like cancer, genetic mutations, skin allergies, and irritation, aiming to make tattooing safer. For artists, it means many traditional inks were banned, requiring the use of new, compliant products.",
