          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking up tattooing 101. What\u2019s a good way to start out as a hobbyist?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To start tattooing as a hobby, you can practice on materials like apples, pears, or raw leather to get a feel for needle depth and machine handling. It's also beneficial to practice shading techniques with pencil or paint on paper. Familiarize yourself with proper needle sizes and adjust tattoo machine speed to understand different shading effects.",
