      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik": "What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Different types of tattoo needles include Round Liners (RL), ideal for outlining designs, and Round Shaders (RS), used for shading and coloring. Magnum needles, such as Stacked Magnum (M1) for blending smaller areas and Round Magnum (RM) for larger coloring, are also common. Flat needles are recommended for intricate shading and shapes. Other types mentioned include Double Magnum (M2) and Turbo needles.",
