      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Helpful, thanks! What are some well-known tattoo education resources, like workshops or online courses?",
          "user_rubrik": "What learning resources are available about tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For formal tattoo education, apprenticeships with professional artists are the standard for hands-on learning. Specialized tattoo academies like Master Tattoo Institute, UK Official Tattoo Academy, or Tattoo School New York & Florida offer intensive courses. While comprehensive online training for tattooing is generally not considered ideal due to its hands-on nature, there are online \"Tattoo Art Courses\" such as \"Master Tattoo Class\" or \"Beginners Guide to Tattooing\" for foundational knowledge. Developing general artistic skills through fine arts programs can also be beneficial.",
