        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting! What kind of equipment is actually needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To start tattooing as a hobby, you'll primarily need a tattoo machine (a rotary machine is often recommended for beginners due to being lightweight, easy to use, and quieter), a power supply, a foot pedal to control the machine, and tattoo needles. You will also need tattoo ink. Many starter kits are available that include these essentials, along with other useful items like a clip cord, grips, tips, ink caps, grommets, o-rings, rubber bands, and practice skin.",
