          "user_utterance": "Are there any regulations about the safety of tattoo needles in Europe?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "While EU regulations like REACH primarily address the safety of tattoo inks and their chemical components, the provided information does not detail specific regulations on the safety standards or materials for tattoo needles themselves in Europe, especially for hobbyist use. Are you looking for information on manufacturing standards, sterility requirements, or general safety practices for hobbyists?",
