      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Actually, I wanted to know about \"REACH compliant\"\u2014what does that mean for tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "\"REACH compliant\" for tattoo needles means that the chemical substances used in their manufacturing, such as the metals or coatings, adhere to the European Union's Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals (REACH) regulation. This ensures that these materials do not contain restricted or hazardous chemicals that could pose risks to human health or the environment. While REACH heavily regulates tattoo inks, it broadly applies to chemicals within any product or article sold in the EU.",
