        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m actually looking into tattooing as a hobby! What\u2019s the first thing I should know about getting started?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The absolute first thing you should know or do when starting tattooing as a hobby is to practice and improve your artistic skills. Tattoo artists need to know how to draw and design, so cultivating your art skill in real life is crucial. This involves practicing drawing, sketching, painting, and even digital art. Building a diverse portfolio of your work is also an important early step.",
