          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting! I\u2019ve been drawing a lot lately, so that\u2019s good to hear. What equipment would I actually need if I wanted to try tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To start tattooing as a hobby, you'll need a tattoo machine (coil, rotary, or pen-style), a power supply, foot pedal, and clip cord. Essential consumables include tattoo inks, pre-sterilized needles, tips, and grips. Don't forget practice skin, ink cups, and cleaning supplies like antibacterial soap and sharp containers. Many starter kits are available that include most of these items, making it easier for beginners.",
