      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks! I\u2019ve heard about different tattoo needles\u2014what types are there?",
          "user_rubrik": "What different tattoo needle types exist?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are several types of tattoo needles, each designed for specific purposes:\n\n*   **Round Liner (RL):** Ideal for outlining designs.\n*   **Round Shader (RS):** Used for shading or coloring within outlines.\n*   **Magnum (M1, M2, RM):** Best for blending and shading, especially for larger areas (Round Magnum, RM) or smaller areas (Stacked Magnum, M1).\n*   **Flat (F):** Recommended for creating shapes, intricate shading, and thin strokes.",
          "citations": {
