          "user_rubrik": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "REACH compliance primarily applies to the chemical composition of tattoo inks, restricting substances linked to health risks. The provided information does not indicate that tattoo needles themselves have specific REACH compliance requirements. Instead, tattoo needles are regulated for safety and hygiene, requiring them to be pre-sterilized, individually packaged, labeled with lot numbers and expiration dates, and made from medical-grade stainless steel for single use to prevent disease.",
