          "user_utterance": "That helps, thank you! Could you suggest more places to learn about tattooing techniques, like courses, books, or online tutorials?",
          "user_rubrik": "What learning resources are available about tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For learning tattooing techniques, you can explore various online courses, such as those listed on platforms like Udemy. Many tattoo schools also offer in-person training covering practical aspects, safety, and machine operation, including places like the Master Tattoo Institute or the UK Official Tattoo Academy. For books, \"Basic Fundamentals of Modern Tattoo\" is recommended for apprentices, and \"The Graphic Art of Tattoo Lettering\" focuses on lettering techniques. Additionally, YouTube offers tutorials, and general art books or tattoo magazines can provide inspiration and design ideas.",
