      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "What kind of equipment do you actually need to get started with tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik": "What equipments are needed to start tattooing?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To begin tattooing as a hobby, you'll need a tattoo machine (a rotary machine is often recommended for beginners), a power supply, a foot pedal, and a clip cord. Essential consumables include tattoo needles and ink. Starter kits frequently provide additional accessories like grips, tips, practice skin, ink caps, o-rings, grommets, rubber bands, and cleaning tools.",
