      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is REACH compliant in tattoo needles?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "REACH compliance, a European Union regulation (Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals), primarily applies to the chemical composition of tattoo inks and permanent make-up, not the physical needles. Its purpose is to protect human health by restricting hazardous substances in inks that can cause allergies, mutations, or cancer. This means inks must meet strict concentration limits for thousands of chemicals.",
