        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I'm actually curious about tattooing 101. How do people even get started with tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to start tattooing as a hobby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To begin tattooing as a hobby, focus on developing your artistic skills and building a portfolio. Practice extensively on fake skin, pigskin, or fruits like apples and pears to master techniques and understand needle depth. For safety, always perform a pigment patch test with inks. While not strictly necessary for a hobby, formal training or an apprenticeship can refine your skills, and proper licensing is required if you ever plan to tattoo others.",
